y":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_1,L_2\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*\">\\(L_1,L_2\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*\\)</span>；机器、输出函数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a31024701b006c36\" href=\"?note=a31024701b006c36\" title=\"27-df-turing-machine\">27-df-turing-machine</a>，运行时间见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fe90a43e6765ed55\" href=\"?note=fe90a43e6765ed55\" title=\"27-df-tm-runtime\">27-df-tm-runtime</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM},\\mathrm{Output}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{TM},\\mathrm{Output}_M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a31024701b006c36\" href=\"?note=a31024701b006c36\" title=\"27-df-turing-machine\">27-df-turing-machine</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Time}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{Time}_M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fe90a43e6765ed55\" href=\"?note=fe90a43e6765ed55\" title=\"27-df-tm-runtime\">27-df-tm-runtime</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Output}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{Output}_M\\)</span> 以部分函数图使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L_1\\leq_p L_2\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\exists f\\in(\\mathbb B^*)^{\\mathbb B^*}\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;((w,f(w))\\in\\mathrm{Output}_M\\land\\mathrm{Time}_M(w)\\leq c(|w|+1)^k\\land(w\\in L_1\\leftrightarrow f(w)\\in L_2)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L_1\\leq_p L_2\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\exists f\\in(\\mathbb B^*)^{\\mathbb B^*}\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;((w,f(w))\\in\\mathrm{Output}_M\\land\\mathrm{Time}_M(w)\\leq c(|w|+1)^k\\land(w\\in L_1\\leftrightarrow f(w)\\in L_2)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>时间上界保证对每个输入停机；输出与总函数 f 相等保证变换单值且全定义。采用 polynomial-time many-one reduction，不把优化问题直接当成语言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"a31024701b006c36","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-tm-runtime","status":"resolved","id":"fe90a43e6765ed55","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-tm-runtime]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"a31024701b006c36","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L_1,L_2\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*$；机器、输出函数见 [[27-df-turing-machine]]，运行时间见 [[27-df-tm-runtime]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-tm-runtime","status":"resolved","id":"fe90a43e6765ed55","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L_1,L_2\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*$；机器、输出函数见 [[27-df-turing-machine]]，运行时间见 [[27-df-tm-runtime]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"a31024701b006c36","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM},\\mathrm{Output}_M$ 见 [[27-df-turing-machine]]，$\\mathrm{Time}_M$ 见 [[27-df-tm-runtime]]；$\\mathrm{Output}_M$ 以部分函数图使用。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-tm-runtime","status":"resolved","id":"fe90a43e6765ed55","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM},\\mathrm{Output}_M$ 见 [[27-df-turing-machine]]，$\\mathrm{Time}_M$ 见 [[27-df-tm-runtime]]；$\\mathrm{Output}_M$ 以部分函数图使用。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L_1,L_2\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM},\\mathrm{Output}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Time}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Output}_M","display":false},{"tex":"L_1\\leq_p L_2\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\exists f\\in(\\mathbb B^*)^{\\mathbb B^*}\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;((w,f(w))\\in\\mathrm{Output}_M\\land\\mathrm{Time}_M(w)\\leq c(|w|+1)^k\\land(w\\in L_1\\leftrightarrow f(w)\\in L_2)).","display":true}],"bytes":1496,"backlinks":[{"id":"43077da4ca08cb6c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leq_p$ (polynomial-time many-one reduction, see [[27-df-polyred]])"},{"id":"f7f08843130d6ad5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leq_p$ (polynomial-time many-one reduction, see [[27-df-polyred]])"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-304","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-polyred|df-polyred — Polynomial-time many-one reduction]]"},{"id":"f0f48d6bfc7c7bfb","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]；$\\mathrm{encDNF},\\mathrm{pair}$ 见 [[27-df-encoding]]，$\\operatorname{bin}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb B^*$ 由下节构造；非空字串 $u$ 的坐标域为 $[|u|]$，$\\iota$ 表示下式已断言存在唯一的对象；$\\mathbf{NP},\\leq_p$ 见 [[27-df-classNP]]、[[27-df-polyred]]。"}],"outgoing":["a31024701b006c36","fe90a43e6765ed55"]}